Imposition of ECQ and GCQ. An ECQ shall be in effect in the
entirety of the following geographic areas, including all provinces, highly-urbanized
cities (HUCs), independent component cities (ICCs), component cities (CCs), and
municipalities situated therein, from 12:01 a.m. of 01 May 2020 to 11:59 p.m. of 15
a. National Capital Region;
b. Region III (Central Luzon), except Aurora Province;
c. Region IV-A (CALABARZON);
Benguet Province;
e. Pangasinan Province;
Iloilo Province;
g. Cebu Province;
h. Bacolod City; and
For the same period, a GCQ is hereby imposed in all other areas of Luzon,
Visayas and Mindanao, provided that, as a precondition, minimum health standards
are achieved and continuously observed in these areas.
Any existing community quarantine imposed by an LGU, regardless of
nomenclature, shall cease to take effect on 12:01 a.m. of 01 May 2020, and shall be
superseded by the ECQ or GCQ herein set forth.
The IATF may lift the GCQ in low-risk areas after 15 May 2020, provided that
no deterioration in their risk level occurs.
